{"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence","doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence\/PersistenceFailure"]]},"sections":[],"abstract":[{"text":"Whether the stack has stopped retrying this write.","type":"text"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence\/PersistenceFailure\/isFinal","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"isFinal"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Bool","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb"}],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"discussion","level":2,"text":"Discussion","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A failed save is retried on a bounded backoff, so most "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".save"},{"type":"text","text":" failures"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"arrive with this "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"false"},{"type":"text","text":" and are followed by a successful attempt the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"app never hears about. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"true"},{"type":"text","text":" means the retry budget is spent: the value"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is still in memory and still protected from being overwritten by the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"stale stored row, but it is "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"not","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" on disk and nothing further will be"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"attempted until the entity is edited again or the app flushes"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"explicitly. This is the one worth telling the user about."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Always "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"false"},{"type":"text","text":" for "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".fetch"},{"type":"text","text":", which is not retried."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"SwiduxPersistence"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"isFinal"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Bool","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb"}],"role":"symbol","symbolKind":"property","title":"isFinal","externalID":"s:17SwiduxPersistence0B7FailureV7isFinalSbvp","roleHeading":"Instance Property"},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/swiduxpersistence\/persistencefailure\/isfinal"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"references":{"doc://SwiduxPersistence/documentation/SwiduxPersistence/PersistenceFailure":{"kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"PersistenceFailure"}],"url":"\/documentation\/swiduxpersistence\/persistencefailure","abstract":[{"text":"A persistence operation that failed.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence\/PersistenceFailure","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"PersistenceFailure"}],"role":"symbol","title":"PersistenceFailure","type":"topic"},"doc://SwiduxPersistence/documentation/SwiduxPersistence/PersistenceFailure/isFinal":{"type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"isFinal"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Bool","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb"}],"url":"\/documentation\/swiduxpersistence\/persistencefailure\/isfinal","title":"isFinal","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence\/PersistenceFailure\/isFinal","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Whether the stack has stopped retrying this write.","type":"text"}]},"doc://Swi